197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 138 0 R
/E (The surface splits into four independent vertical touch strips, spaced out cleanly across the surface. Tap anywhere along a column to jump instantly to a value, or slide smoothly to ride the level up and down. Clear LED meter columns light up beneath your touch, giving you immediate visual feedback on where each channel stands. Full MIDI RX implementation lets your DAW send values back to ZONA, essentially giving you the behavior of motorized faders as lights snap to current project levels and follow automations seamlessly.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 138 0 R
/E (Whenever you need direct, multi-channel hands-on control without reaching for mechanical knobs or faders. It fits four-track volume leveling, dedicated wet/dry sends on multiple return tracks, envelope shaping across attack, decay, sustain, and release, or steering four macro controls across your live set simultaneously. Bidirectional feedback also makes it ideal for jumping between DAW tracks without parameter jumps.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 138 0 R
/E (One strip at a time. Enable MIDI output from your DAW track back to ZONA so incoming CC updates illuminate the strips dynamically. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
